- Structured percent/brace format arguments redact the exact credential positions and retain safe arguments.
- Arbitrary unsupported diagnostic values fail closed to type markers.
- Compound, bytes, frozenset, and unsupported mapping keys cannot expose mapped credentials.
- Spaced sensitive labels, header-style Authorization, nested structured values, and diagnostic tails redact fully.
